'''Mniaceae''' is a [[moss]] family in the order Bryales.<ref name="itis">{{cite web |title=ITIS Standard Report Page: Mniaceae |url=https://www.itis.gov/servlet/SingleRpt/SingleRpt?search_topic=TSN&search_value=16024#null |website=www.itis.gov |access-date=15 December 2019}}</ref><ref name=Goffinet-2008>{{cite book |last1=Goffinet |first1=B. |first2=W. R. |last2=Buck |first3=A. J. |last3=Shaw |year=2008 |chapter=Morphology and Classification of the Bryophyta |pages=55–138 |editor-last1=Goffinet |editor-first1=B. |editor-first2=J. |editor-last2=Shaw |title=Bryophyte Biology |edition=2nd |location=New York |publisher=Cambridge University Press |isbn=978-0-521-87225-6 |chapter-url=https://books.google.com/books?id=te0fAwAAQBAJ&pg=PT108}}</ref><ref name=Goffinet-2020-web>{{cite web |last1=Goffinet |first1=B. |first2=W.R. |last2=Buck |title=Classification of extant moss genera  |website=Classification of the Bryophyta |url=http://bryology.uconn.edu/classification/#BRYIDAE |access-date=1 May 2020}}</ref>

==Taxonomy==

The family Mniaceae includes the following genera:<ref name=fna>{{eFloras|1|10577|volume=28|Mniaceae|last=McIntosh|first=Terry T. |accessdate=16 December 2019}}</ref><ref name=Goffinet-2020-web/>

* ''[[Cinclidium (plant)|Cinclidium]]'' {{small|[[Sw.]]}}
* ''[[Cyrtomnium]]'' {{small|Holmen}}
* ''[[Epipterygium]]'' {{small|[[Lindb.]]}} 
* ''[[Leucolepis]]'' {{small|[[Lindb.]]}}
* ''[[Mielichhoferia]]'' {{small|Nees & Hornsch.}}
* ''[[Mnium]]'' {{small|[[Hedw.]]}}
* ''[[Orthomnion]]'' {{small|Wilson}}
* ''[[Plagiomnium]]'' {{small|[[T. J. Koponen]]}}
* ''[[Pohlia]]'' {{small|Hedw.}}
* ''[[Pseudobryum]]'' {{small|([[Kindb.]]) T. J. Koponen}}
* ''[[Pseudopohlia]]'' {{small|R. S. Williams}}
* ''[[Rhizomnium]]'' {{small|([[Broth.]]) T. J. Koponen}}
* ''[[Schizymenium]]'' {{small|[[Harv.]]}}
* ''[[Synthetodontium]]'' {{small|Cardot}}
* ''[[Trachycystis (plant)|Trachycystis]]'' {{small|Lindberg}}{{clarify|reason=Flora of North America gives Lindb. as authority; Goffinet's book and web versions give T. J. Kop|date=May 2020}}

